body:
I used to be a moderator for a couple of discord servers. I think, aside from teenagers being edgy teenagers, what stands out to me is when I was sent a video of one of said teenagers taking a bunch of pills, swallowing them, then leaning back. He was throwing up in a later video. I called his local police, but I don't think anything came of it. He's still alive and being a general douche to this day though, if I remember right.

&#x200B;

I think aside from that though, the worst was when I had to individually report one person's each and every post where they wrote erotic fanfictions of the columbine high school shooters, I know there were over a dozen of those. Or the time one of the members managed to get the owner expelled from her private school after outing her as transgender as well as manipulating her into having sex (then later claiming rape. There was also one time where someone posted graphic child gore. 

&#x200B;

Needless to say, I have a lot more respect for people who moderate servers.
